# 26.3 moved rendering onto the renderpearl backend and deleted the text-background pipelines.
# RenderTypes.textBackgroundSeeThrough() went with them, and it was the only stock render type
# that drew untextured POSITION_COLOR quads with no depth test - what the hologram uses to show
# obstructions buried in terrain.
#
# The replacement pipeline is built entirely from public API (see EbpRenderTypes); the one piece
# vanilla keeps to itself is the call that wraps a RenderSetup into a RenderType.
